{#
  The drop-in that gives a user-manager unit a dependency on something in the
  *system* manager.

  A unit in one service's user manager cannot `Requires=` a unit in another's:
  they are two different dependency graphs and systemd does not cross them. This
  is the only place a generated unit can acquire one, and the real edges live in
  `<service>.target`, which `loom` emits and the mutator installs.
#}
